{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
  MyFrequentRewards — lifecycle email system v6
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 02. Terms not accepted
  File       : case2-terms.liquid
  Class      : Case 2 (transactional — no unsubscribe)
  Trigger    : Password created, research terms not accepted / no return login
  Tone        : invitation

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. {{ member.first_name | default: "Your" }}, one item is still outstanding on your account
    2. Two of three done — the last step takes one tap
    3. Your account is built but not yet active

  PREHEADER
    Accepting the research terms is what lets us match you to studies. One tap.

  PRIMARY CTA
    Accept and activate  ->  links.accept_terms

  PLAIN-TEXT ALTERNATIVE
    dist/text/case2-terms.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.
    HTML-only mail is scored down by most spam filters.

  Generated from react/src/emails/case2-terms.jsx — edit the JSX and re-run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.

  Images are served from the base configured at build time; upload assets/
  there before sending. Serve over HTTPS from a stable path — clients do not
  retry a 404, so a moved asset breaks every copy already delivered.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
